    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/e630985a008e589534fbb60b972f79bc.poster.avif?t=1750194027\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/e630985a008e589534fbb60b972f79bc.webm?t=1750194027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/e630985a008e589534fbb60b972f79bc.mp4?t=1750194027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play casual runs lasting an average of 20 minutes, exploring 6 distinct maps and facing over 100 unique monster types. Play with 60 different spells, choose between 6 playable characters, and face 12 challenging bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR ELEMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose an initial element between fire, water, poison, electric, earth, ice, which will define your trajectory based on it, but you will still be able to use the other elements when you unlock them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/2a358e86def78386ea4a7b77be0a64ec.avif?t=1750194027\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive and battle 12 different bosses with unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/e6592084df70c8034c59c7a3a5025a5e.poster.avif?t=1750194027\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/e6592084df70c8034c59c7a3a5025a5e.webm?t=1750194027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/e6592084df70c8034c59c7a3a5025a5e.mp4?t=1750194027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT SPELLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 60 unique elemental spells through monster drops, choose and upgrade them in the portal room to make your next attempts easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/35608de91d6f4a07642aaf2e5e49a4a4.poster.avif?t=1750194027\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/35608de91d6f4a07642aaf2e5e49a4a4.webm?t=1750194027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/35608de91d6f4a07642aaf2e5e49a4a4.mp4?t=1750194027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FRIENDS LEADERBOARD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with your friends to see who does the most damage and finishes the maps and minigames the fastest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/274e867e3cbc7063e10cc03f04f3ff19.poster.avif?t=1750194027\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/274e867e3cbc7063e10cc03f04f3ff19.webm?t=1750194027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/e630985a008e589534fbb60b972f79bc.poster.avif?t=1750194027\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/e630985a008e589534fbb60b972f79bc.webm?t=1750194027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/e630985a008e589534fbb60b972f79bc.mp4?t=1750194027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play casual runs lasting an average of 20 minutes, exploring 6 distinct maps and facing over 100 unique monster types. Play with 60 different spells, choose between 6 playable characters, and face 12 challenging bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR ELEMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose an initial element between fire, water, poison, electric, earth, ice, which will define your trajectory based on it, but you will still be able to use the other elements when you unlock them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/2a358e86def78386ea4a7b77be0a64ec.avif?t=1750194027\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive and battle 12 different bosses with unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/e6592084df70c8034c59c7a3a5025a5e.poster.avif?t=1750194027\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/e6592084df70c8034c59c7a3a5025a5e.webm?t=1750194027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/e6592084df70c8034c59c7a3a5025a5e.mp4?t=1750194027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT SPELLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 60 unique elemental spells through monster drops, choose and upgrade them in the portal room to make your next attempts easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/35608de91d6f4a07642aaf2e5e49a4a4.poster.avif?t=1750194027\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/35608de91d6f4a07642aaf2e5e49a4a4.webm?t=1750194027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/35608de91d6f4a07642aaf2e5e49a4a4.mp4?t=1750194027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FRIENDS LEADERBOARD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with your friends to see who does the most damage and finishes the maps and minigames the fastest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/274e867e3cbc7063e10cc03f04f3ff19.poster.avif?t=1750194027\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/274e867e3cbc7063e10cc03f04f3ff19.webm?t=1750194027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Dachs Hunter is a survivors-like top-down roguelite game where you play as a dachshund wizard battling through hordes of elemental monsters. Discover and collect unique spells, master all elements, and strategize your way to survival.",
